#: src/app/automationpage.cpp:292
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Print requests over HTTP need Qt HTTP Server, which was not installed when "
"Plasma Label Creator was built (dev-qt/qthttpserver on Gentoo, qt6-"
"httpserver-dev on Debian and Ubuntu, qt6-qthttpserver-devel on Fedora, qt6-"
"httpserver on Arch). Install it and build Plasma Label Creator again to use "
"them; watched folders work without it."
msgstr ""
"Afdrukverzoeken via HTTP hebben Qt HTTP Server nodig, en dat was niet "
"geïnstalleerd toen Plasma Label Creator werd gebouwd (dev-qt/qthttpserver op "
"Gentoo, qt6-httpserver-dev op Debian en Ubuntu, qt6-qthttpserver-devel op "
"Fedora, qt6-httpserver op Arch). Installeer het en bouw Plasma Label Creator "
"opnieuw om ze te gebruiken; bewaakte mappen werken ook zonder."

